---
// Testimonial Quote Banner Component - Nexus Fitness Court
---

<section class="quote-section" aria-label="Member Testimonial Highlight">
  <div class="container quote-container">
    <div class="quote-badge-row">
      <div class="quote-icon-box">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="#eab308">
          <path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="quote-text">
      "I TRIED MULTIPLE GYMS IN SOUTH NAGPUR, BUT NOTHING COMPARES TO THE ENERGY AND EQUIPMENT AT <span class="text-nexus">NEXUS FITNESS COURT</span>. THE GYMQUIP MACHINES AND TRAINER ATTENTION ARE TOP TIER."
    </blockquote>

    <div class="quote-author-row">
      <div class="stars-gold" aria-label="5 stars rating">
        ★★★★★
      </div>
      <div class="author-pill">
        <span class="author-dot"></span>
        <span class="author-name">Kunal Rathod &bull; Besa Road Member (-16kg Recomp)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .quote-section {
    padding: 7rem 0;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.08) 0%, #07080b 70%);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .quote-container {
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .quote-badge-row {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .quote-icon-box {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-nexus);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.3);
  }
  .quote-text {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.95rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .quote-text {
      font-size: 2.75rem;
    }
  }
  .quote-author-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .stars-gold {
    color: #facc15;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
  .author-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.45rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-nexus);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.18);
  }
  .author-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--primary);
  }
  .author-name {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>
